  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\n2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Golden Dragon Coin Capsulated\nby\nPerth Mint\n✓ LBMA Good Delivery\n$\n90.30\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nMetal\nSilver\nWeight\n1 oz Troy Ounces\nPurity\n99.99\nType\nCoin\n81 In stock\nQty\nQuantity\nCheck/Wire\nCrypto\nCard/Paypal\n1-9\n1 - 9\n0%\n$\n90.13\n$\n91.93\n$\n94.64\n10-99\n10 - 99\n0.05%\n$\n90.08\n$\n91.89\n$\n94.59\n100+\n100 +\n1%\n$\n89.23\n$\n91.01\n$\n93.69\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nSKU:\ns1ocgoldra1\nCategories:\nGifts\n,\nGovernment Mint Silver Coins\n,\nGovernment Minted Silver Coins\n,\nReligious Collection\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Coins\nMint:\nPerth Mint\nPrice history\n2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Golden Dragon Coin Capsulated was last recorded at $90.33 on October 9, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is up 10.5% and has ranged between $76.00 and $155.35.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\nIntroducing the 2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Golden Dragon Coin, the latest release from Perth Mint’s revered Lunar Series III. Celebrating the Year of the Dragon, this exquisite coin features a vibrant golden colorization of the dragon, a revered symbol in Chinese culture known for its wisdom and power. With a limited mintage of only 200,000 coins, this collectible is a must-have for both investors and numismatic enthusiasts.\nKey Features:\nLimited Edition:\nOnly 200,000 coins minted, adding significant collectible appeal.\nExceptional Quality:\nProduced by the historic Perth Mint, which has been known for its superior craftsmanship and detailed designs since 1899.\nCultural Richness:\nEmbraces the essence of the Chinese Lunar Calendar with the Year of the Dragon, offering a piece rich in cultural symbolism.\nInvestment Potential:\nAn excellent addition to silver portfolios, providing both value retention and aesthetic appeal.\nProduct Specifications:\nMint:\nPerth Mint\nCondition:\nNew, Brilliant Uncirculated\nDiameter:\n40.90 mm\nThickness:\n3.50 mm\nPurity:\n.9999 fine silver\nWeight:\n1 oz\nSecure your 2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Golden Dragon Coin today from Bullion Trading LLC. Available at our physical location in New York, or through our online store, this coin is a standout piece that represents both a wise investment and a beautiful collector’s item. Don’t miss the opportunity to own a part of this limited series, celebrated for its design excellence and cultural significance. Visit us for competitive pricing and exceptional customer service.\nAdditional information\nMetal\nSilver\nProduct Type\nnumismatic_coin\nIssuer Country\nAU\nIs Legal Tender\nYes\nIs Monetized Bullion\nNo\nPurity %\n99.99\nWeight\n1 oz\nType of Bullion\nCoin\nWeight Unit\nTroy Ounces\nRelated products\nOut of stock\nRead more\n1 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nGold Bars\n,\nReligious Collection\n1 oz PAMP Suisse – Lakshmi Gold Bar(New w/Assay)\n$\n4,393.23\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\nGifts\n,\nSecondary Market Gold & Silver\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n1000.9 OZ Johnson Matthey Silver Bar Rare Collectable .999\n$\n60,133.63\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n,\nSilver Bullets for Sale\n2 oz Silver Bullet\n$\n160.16\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\nGifts\n,\nGram Silver Bars\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n100 x 1 Gram Valcambi Silver CombiBar\n$\n403.16\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\n$\n90.30\nAdd to cart\nLogin/Register\nDon't have an account\nRegister\nCustome